 "integration": {
  "summary": "Read 3x0028-3x0030 (temperatures x10), 3x0022 (application state) and 3x0055/3x0056 (damper positions); write 4x0002 for state and 4x0036/4x0042/4x0043 for airflow levels in l/s. Temperature setpoints, measured airflows and CO2 are not in this map because the manual gives no scaling for them.",
  "minimum_registers": [
